    "findings": "[{\"id\":\"DEV-SCRIPT-MISSING_dev.sh_0\",\"category\":\"deployment\",\"severity\":\"WARNING\",\"title\":\"dev.sh Belum Ada di Root Proyek\",\"description\":\"Proyek wajib punya dev.sh di root yang menyalakan semua komponen (BE, FE, mobile) dengan satu perintah, memakai port dari blok proyek di PORTS.md dan env FE→BE yang menunjuk port BE.\",\"suggestion\":\"Buat dev.sh: set PORT tiap komponen dari blok PORTS.md, ekspor URL API BE ke FE/mobile, jalankan semua komponen paralel, dan hentikan semuanya dengan trap saat Ctrl+C.\",\"target_file\":\"dev.sh\",\"rule_id\":\"DEV-SCRIPT-MISSING\",\"theory_basis\":\"ARCH-002 Unified Local Orchestration (Dev Runner).\",\"suggested_fix\":\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# Jalankan semua komponen proyek sekaligus. Port dari blok PORTS.md (Aturan 35).\\nset -e\\nROOT=\\\"$(cd \\\"$(dirname \\\"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\\\")\\\" \\u0026\\u0026 pwd)\\\"\\nBE_PORT=\\\"${BE_PORT:-4105}\\\"; FE_PORT=\\\"${FE_PORT:-4100}\\\"\\nLAN_IP=\\\"$(hostname -I 2\\u003e/dev/null | awk '{print $1}')\\\"; LAN_IP=\\\"${LAN_IP:-127.0.0.1}\\\"\\ntrap 'kill 0' EXIT INT TERM\\n(cd \\\"$ROOT/backend\\\" \\u0026\\u0026 PORT=$BE_PORT go run .) \\u0026\\n(cd \\\"$ROOT/frontend\\\" \\u0026\\u0026 PORT=$FE_PORT NUXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://localhost:$BE_PORT bun run dev) \\u0026\\n# (cd \\\"$ROOT/mobile\\\" \\u0026\\u0026 flutter run --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=http://$LAN_IP:$BE_PORT) \\u0026\\nwait\",\"status\":\"open\"},{\"id\":\"DEPLOY-SCRIPT-MISSING_deploy.sh_0\",\"category\":\"deployment\",\"severity\":\"WARNING\",\"title\":\"deploy.sh Belum Ada di Root Proyek\",\"description\":\"Proyek wajib punya deploy.sh: pengguna cukup mengisi .env.server (atau .env.\\u003cnama\\u003e pilihannya), skrip memasangnya sebagai env aktif, build \\u0026 upload ke server, lalu mengembalikan .env.local walau deploy gagal.\",\"suggestion\":\"Buat deploy.sh dengan argumen nama env (default server), salin .env.\\u003cnama\\u003e ke berkas env aktif, trap EXIT untuk memulihkan .env.local, dan pastikan .gitignore memuat .env / .env.* / !.env.example.\",\"target_file\":\"deploy.sh\",\"rule_id\":\"DEPLOY-SCRIPT-MISSING\",\"theory_basis\":\"SEC-002 \\u0026 DEV-007: hanya .env.example yang di-commit; env server dipasang saat deploy saja.\",\"suggested_fix\":\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# ./deploy.sh [nama-env]  → pakai .env.\\u003cnama-env\\u003e (default: server), lalu kembali ke .env.local.\\nset -e\\nROOT=\\\"$(cd \\\"$(dirname \\\"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\\\")\\\" \\u0026\\u0026 pwd)\\\"\\nTARGET=\\\"${1:-server}\\\"\\nDIRS=(backend frontend)\\nfor d in \\\"${DIRS[@]}\\\"; do\\n  [ -f \\\"$ROOT/$d/.env.$TARGET\\\" ] || { echo \\\"Isi dulu $d/.env.$TARGET (salin dari .env.example)\\\"; exit 1; }\\ndone\\n# deploy pertama: simpan env dev sekarang sebagai .env.local agar tidak pernah hilang\\nfor d in \\\"${DIRS[@]}\\\"; do [ -f \\\"$ROOT/$d/.env.local\\\" ] || [ ! -f \\\"$ROOT/$d/.env\\\" ] || cp \\\"$ROOT/$d/.env\\\" \\\"$ROOT/$d/.env.local\\\"; done\\nrestore() { for d in \\\"${DIRS[@]}\\\"; do [ ! -f \\\"$ROOT/$d/.env.local\\\" ] || cp \\\"$ROOT/$d/.env.local\\\" \\\"$ROOT/$d/.env\\\"; done; }\\ntrap restore EXIT\\nfor d in \\\"${DIRS[@]}\\\"; do cp \\\"$ROOT/$d/.env.$TARGET\\\" \\\"$ROOT/$d/.env\\\"; done\\n# build + upload; host \\u0026 path server dibaca dari .env.$TARGET (DEPLOY_HOST, DEPLOY_PATH)\\nset -a; . \\\"$ROOT/backend/.env.$TARGET\\\"; set +a\\n(cd \\\"$ROOT/backend\\\" \\u0026\\u0026 GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -o app .)\\n(cd \\\"$ROOT/frontend\\\" \\u0026\\u0026 bun run build)\\nrsync -az --delete \\\"$ROOT/backend/app\\\" \\\"$ROOT/frontend/.output\\\" \\\"$DEPLOY_HOST:$DEPLOY_PATH/\\\"\",\"status\":\"open\"},{\"id\":\"PROJ-NO-TESTS_api_0\",\"category\":\"quality\",\"severity\":\"INFO\",\"title\":\"No Automated Tests Detected in api\",\"description\":\"Component 'api' has no test suites detected.\",\"suggestion\":\"Add unit or integration tests to ensure regression-free development.\",\"target_file\":\"api\",\"component\":\"api\",\"rule_id\":\"PROJ-NO-TESTS\",\"status\":\"open\"}]",
    "score": 89,
    "summary": "Analyzed 1 components across bundle architecture. Total 3 findings (3 aktif, 0 diabaikan, 0 diselesaikan). Codebase health score: 89/100."
